menu "sys_session"

    config SYS_SESSION_MAX
        int "Sessions"
        default 4
        range 1 16
        help
          Sessions: providers with a peer on them, a board or a client.

    #@limit @alias Calls to other boards
    config SYS_SESSION_CALLS
        int "Calls in flight"
        default 16
        range 1 64
        help
          The board's own requests to other boards waiting for an answer
          (sys_session_call); a call to this board takes none. Every call to
          another board is answered, so each write of a remote device in
          flight takes one. A slot is about 52 B.

    #@limit @alias Call timeout @unit ms
    config SYS_SESSION_CALL_TIMEOUT_MS
        int "Call timeout (ms)"
        default 1000
        range 50 10000
        help
          A call without an answer this long ends with ERR_SESSION_TIMEOUT,
          unless the caller gives its own. Longer than a radio's tail, so a
          slow answer is not taken for a lost one.

    config SYS_SESSION_BOARD_ID_DEFAULT
        int "Board id until the app sets one"
        default 0
        range 0 239
        help
          The board's id when none is kept in NVS (ID). Two boards of one
          project need different ids: the app sets them with ID.

endmenu
